Package: glyfp
Title: Structural Fingerprints for Glycans
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Bin", "Fu", , "23110220018@m.fudan.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8567-2997"))
Description: Encodes glycan structures as binary or count vectors of
    connected residue substructures, circular residue neighborhoods, and
    residue-pair graph distances. Motif fingerprints use a fixed
    dictionary derived from complete structures in 'glydb' or a dictionary
    built from the current batch.  Residue identities, substituents, and
    glycosidic linkage labels are taken from 'glyrepr' structures.
    Optionally computes pretrained 'SweetNet', 'GlycanGT', and 'GIFFLAR'
    embeddings using 'torch' for R on the CPU and verified local model
    weights.
